usage: qualify-x3f-sd10.py [-h] --libraw-root LIBRAW_ROOT
                           [--library-dir LIBRARY_DIR] --target-dir TARGET_DIR
                           --report REPORT [--dcraw-source DCRAW_SOURCE]
                           [--sd14-source SD14_SOURCE]
                           [--artifacts-dir ARTIFACTS_DIR] [--metal-readback]
                           [--timeout TIMEOUT]
                           source

Pinned SD10 arithmetic qualification. External LibRaw is a test oracle only.

positional arguments:
  source

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --libraw-root LIBRAW_ROOT
                        Isolated 0.22.2 source build with USE_X3FTOOLS and
                        static libraw.a
  --library-dir LIBRARY_DIR
  --target-dir TARGET_DIR
  --report REPORT
  --dcraw-source DCRAW_SOURCE
                        Pinned independent standalone dcraw.c; enables full
                        output and rotation checks
  --sd14-source SD14_SOURCE
